      "aiNotes": "Actual independent image review: curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-visualization-review/wirtschaft-e1-seventeen-image-author-20261008-v1/independent-review/21dd1fce-730a-5470-bcc3-76195941ee83/independent-image-review.receipt.json (sha256:00b27b51479acb6ab87f255b2c7d9bf571da1bcdc1c09e282133ea48dede8697). A worker weighs digital assistance and remote cooperation against issues of time, further training and security. The neutral paired trays make deliberation clear without guaranteeing job gains, inevitable job loss or asserting that every digital tool is safe. At 360 px robot/remote meeting, training book, clock and lock remain large and clear alongside the main title. At 680 px the selected opportunities and response/risk considerations are recognizable without quantitative claims. The displayed laptop screen faces the audience as a conceptual presentation, not as a reversed screen being used by the central actor. The trays are illustrative weighing symbols."
