      "aiReviewer": "OpenAI Codex economics_visual_memory_audit",
      "aiNotes": "Actual independent image review: curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-visualization-review/wirtschaft-e2-twenty-image-author-20261008-v1/independent-review/bad728f2-e375-5f98-8f65-511a9e2e6751/independent-image-review.receipt.json (sha256:65e0df5bfbbbc3fe66cb85945704ea0772b61c6d88c1f17416a173551f9e2a5c). A dashed boundary separates the paying repair transaction from a third-party neighbor affected by emitted smoke. The neighbor has no coin exchange, correctly illustrating an external cost rather than a contractual cost to the buyer. No quantity, current diagnosis or universal assertion about all bicycle workshops is invented. At 360 px the two transaction parties, coin transfer, boundary, smoke and affected neighbor remain recognizable, with a readable third-party heading. At 680 px the transaction versus uncompensated outside effect is clear; the source chimney and the neighbor response are visually connected. The repair/customer actors face each other and the neighbor reacts toward the plume; public workshop signage correctly faces passers-by. No directional notebook or measuring display is used."
    },
