      "aiReviewer": "OpenAI Codex economics_visual_memory_audit",
      "aiNotes": "Actual independent image review: curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-visualization-review/wirtschaft-e1-seventeen-image-author-20261008-v1/independent-review/0eaf70cd-b7b9-582b-8e77-7002b414d494/independent-image-review.receipt.json (sha256:42be2947aecdbb5ef00f01653e5e838ca2a44cd24a049051179b3ad2a5b0d350). A shared policy discussion compares care and education scenarios and links them to time, knowledge and access. Several adults share care and instruction; no exact entitlement, spending amount or automatic causal payoff is invented. At 360 px both scenario headings, learning/care scenes and central time/knowledge/access icons are clear; side slogans are optional. At 680 px the concrete mechanisms of care time and learning/access are easy to discuss without detailed law text. The tutor and learner face a normally oriented open book, and discussion participants face the moderator/cards. Generic notes do not contain inverted required text."
