      "aiReviewer": "OpenAI Codex economics_visual_memory_audit",
      "aiNotes": "Actual independent image review: curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-visualization-review/wirtschaft-e1-seventeen-image-author-20261008-v1/independent-review/7aef0e2f-ca08-5276-a432-906cdb3313b4/independent-image-review.receipt.json (sha256:ca3dccac71402ba3660be972f01ea6ef4775948ab82fba2abafd52809fb88f06). Three labelled lenses show different explanatory dimensions over the same neighborhood: income/work, lifestyle and relationships. They introduce different model questions without inventing class proportions, ranking people, equating income and lifestyle or asserting one factor completely explains society. At 360 px the same neighborhood, all three lens headings and large corresponding symbols are clear; tiny background signs are optional. At 680 px the shared setting and different selected dimensions remain easy to compare. Actors look through the lenses toward the same neighborhood; their positions are coherent, and no actor reads a reversed compulsory document."
