      "aiNotes": "Actual independent image review: curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-visualization-review/wirtschaft-e2-twenty-image-author-20261008-v1/independent-review/cb21bcbe-755d-5b0d-b02a-be22c9d26e43/independent-image-review.receipt.json (sha256:9ed529dd17dd306475e228459076e0761313c33295e216d81c7de085e1013b00). Four separate shops versus two demonstrate supplier concentration. Balanced gear/choice scale marks efficiency potential versus fewer independent suppliers. It does not show price increases or declare concentration invariably harmful. 360 px preserves four-versus-two storefront structure and central balanced gear/bicycle comparison. Tiny decorative shop poster is not needed to read the concept. 680 px shows friendly suppliers and thoughtful customers; scale labels and main headings are readable. Shop signs and neutral comparison scale face the viewer; no actor-dependent chart/document inversion."
