      "aiReviewedAt": "2026-10-08",
      "aiReviewer": "OpenAI Codex economics_visual_memory_audit",
      "aiNotes": "Actual independent image review: curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-visualization-review/wirtschaft-e1-seventeen-image-author-20261008-v1/independent-review/7a3f0ae8-370e-5fc3-afce-09e1f7f35508/independent-image-review.receipt.json (sha256:d40bac261cccfe75b1e68835c59d8368988059ee29a475fdbf773cbaa14dbc45). A diverse civic discussion considers housing, education and work as shared opportunities and challenges. People retain equal dignity and contribute as participants; appearance does not label anyone as a migrant, dependent burden or fixed cultural representative. The question avoids guaranteeing integration outcomes. At 360 px the shared discussion, housing/book/gear icons and large judgment question are recognizable. Secondary slogans are decorative. At 680 px the concrete housing, learning and work topics and reciprocal participation are clear. The moderator holds a tablet facing herself while its plain back faces the audience; people face the discussion and public board. No actor-inverted readable page occurs."
    },
