      "aiNotes": "Actual independent image review: curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-visualization-review/wirtschaft-e1-seventeen-image-author-20261008-v1/independent-review/bf851227-f345-5a6e-9c6a-392d2edd1e91/independent-image-review.receipt.json (sha256:7426cb9e0f8a3c639e1bcc78ea83b00c3a31d03a5335f83aa45c13bd928260e8). Close support from friends/family and a teacher or occupational mentor illustrate different network resources. The branching opportunities and explicit note that access can differ avoid implying automatic employment, deserved superiority or universal equal access. At 360 px the two support groups, connected learner, path sign and open/questioned network are clear. Small speech words supplement the main scenes. At 680 px everyday support and bridging information/opportunity can be distinguished with the conditional mentor phrase. The mentor holds a tablet with its plain back facing the audience; people face their discussion partners. Signposts correctly face the common path view."
