      "aiNotes": "Actual independent image review: curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-visualization-review/wirtschaft-e2-twenty-image-author-20261008-v1/independent-review/80c92945-155b-56ea-8aa2-46ee72852303/independent-image-review.receipt.json (sha256:0e7ed6f8fc49d458b3ff3c9b372fe0a569606a565591986b9eb7cdcb03b75ce9). A productive bicycle workshop shares air and river space with residents: visible plume and discharge illustrate environmental effects beside useful output. No emission quantity, toxicity diagnosis or universal market-economy claim is invented. At 360 px workshop, chimney plume, river discharge and observing residents remain visible; tiny fish and advertising text are optional decoration. 680 px keeps the workshop/river/person relationship and environmental heading clear; smoke/pipe establish the environmental question. Resident points toward the river in their own line of sight. Factory signs face viewers/customers, no backward worksheet or measurement display."
