      "aiApprovedAssetSha256": "sha256:67b763cc26c4155fc89d7ee0f296ed4145040db7da414ff29d6eb6008bc8c68d",
      "aiReviewedAt": "2026-10-08",
      "aiReviewer": "OpenAI Codex economics_visual_memory_audit",
      "aiNotes": "Actual independent image review: curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-visualization-review/wirtschaft-e1-seventeen-image-author-20261008-v1/independent-review/77edbcf9-d14d-547e-8a5f-43863a3e300b/independent-image-review.receipt.json (sha256:d1a3175ce5cf02852e6ea760246678b8d7b87a148c15c556a2f2c4ac5350b176). A civic roundtable links changed needs to explicitly possible political measures: childcare, training and accessible housing. Equal participation and the word Mögliche prevent the arrow from becoming a guarantee of successful policy effects. Friendly participants and shared deliberation do not assert a current party programme. At360px the title, roundtable, large direction arrow and three policy-family icons are clear. Small speech bubbles are supplementary examples, not required to identify policy responses. At680px the distinction between needs and possible measures and the examples can be read without dense legal detail. The displayed tabletop symbols and labels are explanatory overlays; people face their discussion partners. Blank/generic notes do not contain actor-inverted compulsory text."
    },
