      "aiReviewer": "OpenAI Codex economics_visual_memory_audit",
      "aiNotes": "Actual independent image review: curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-visualization-review/wirtschaft-e1-seventeen-image-author-20261008-v1/independent-review/af772e72-57c9-5aab-a500-7fe3ec692abc/independent-image-review.receipt.json (sha256:fab25eb500ea21ed279e5306f7aafde448777a907570a2df85b59224e9e7cc0d). Qualification/training and financial support/advice are offered as two possible responses and explicitly described as complementary. The thoughtful comparison and conceptual time/skills balance avoid implying an automatic employment outcome, mutually exclusive policy choices or exact benefit entitlements. At 360 px both measure headings, learning/advice scenes, money purse and comparison scale remain recognizable; secondary book labels are optional. At 680 px the complementary sentence and the different response mechanisms are legible without legal detail. The instructor and counselor face the participants; blank/generic documents do not carry actor-inverted required text. The training laptop is reasonably angled toward its learner."
