      "aiApprovedAssetSha256": "sha256:9c953f4ac3f773b5bfbc21ff753eda2cd756a53c918a25abed6c9c51780fb8b8",
      "aiReviewedAt": "2026-10-08",
      "aiReviewer": "OpenAI Codex economics_visual_memory_audit",
      "aiNotes": "Actual independent image review: curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-visualization-review/wirtschaft-e2-twenty-image-author-20261008-v1/independent-review/8b28e36b-79ec-5869-9359-45ff68e28f64/independent-image-review.receipt.json (sha256:a4af9431b4dd5d347de6094c02415d85631ef597bb5a059fd8ba23d2cacdc885). Environmental air/water/ecosystem symbols and human quality-of-life social/health/education symbols are contrasted over a shared settlement. No values, causal coefficients or universal indicator ranking are invented; the common setting invites interpretation of different dimensions. At 360 px both panel headings and all large indicator-family icons remain recognizable. Building slogans and background micro-scenes are optional. At 680 px the shared surroundings, public transport, social life and educational context provide clear concrete examples without cluttering the central panels. The presenter gestures toward both panels for an audience; the open book is a non-directional icon and public signs face the scene rather than an actor reading a reversed page."
    },
