      "aiReviewedAt": "2026-10-08",
      "aiReviewer": "OpenAI Codex economics_visual_memory_audit",
      "aiNotes": "Actual independent image review: curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-visualization-review/wirtschaft-e2-twenty-image-author-20261008-v1/independent-review/c3cb822e-f219-5a66-9714-db73b50d0487/independent-image-review.receipt.json (sha256:17212bb2ae225bf53134d04ac1046ba1120548739b9c6ed39f62a4285ed570d6). Kommune, Bund and EU are illustrative governance levels linked by large bidirectional coordination arrows over a shared environmental space. No arrow claims a command hierarchy or a concrete legal competence. At 360 px all three labels and both bidirectional arrows are identifiable without reading documents. 680 px shows discussion at each level and a shared river as the environmental subject. Hand-held sheets are blank and tablets face users; no imposed viewer-readable content from the wrong actor perspective."
