      "aiReviewer": "OpenAI Codex economics_visual_memory_audit",
      "aiNotes": "Actual independent image review: curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-visualization-review/wirtschaft-e2-twenty-image-author-20261008-v1/independent-review/b7633a54-6980-566b-bf8b-262e1841bd7d/independent-image-review.receipt.json (sha256:f876c1f66292fd8f84976f584b07bc4074081014b31cbe0acbab4e5b23c78cf1). Production, environmental and balancing-policy interests receive separate large thought symbols around a shared river/town model. Cooperative discussion makes competing perspectives intelligible without assigning a winner or treating one actor as a villain. 360 px retains all three people, distinct gear/leaf/scale symbols and shared central setting; detailed miniature buildings are not essential. 680 px exposes the common environmental decision object and reciprocal conversational gestures. The round physical model is usable from every seat; no directional writing or measurement instrument is reversed."
