      "aiNotes": "Actual independent image review: curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-visualization-review/wirtschaft-e1-seventeen-image-author-20261008-v1/independent-review/ae91ad7d-82cb-58e2-bf01-5ef6d9fe445b/correction-v2/independent-image-review.receipt.json (sha256:f9276367e0673eba5fb7b000ea416800ba19283d42fcbbd1836d308813420321). The same identifiable girl with curly dark hair and medium-brown skin is actually shown in both hypothetical A/B conditions. Both walking figures share orange clothing and teal backpacks. Quiet/noisy study circumstances, different book/money/time resources and easier/harder routes remain the factors being compared; demographic identity is no longer coupled to disadvantage. Both versions are motivated and moving toward the same school, without inevitable failure. At 360 px A/B, both comparable learner figures, school, easier/harder paths and distinct resource groups remain recognisable. The home labels reinforce the scene without mandatory fine print. At 680 px curly hair, skin tone and facial identity agree across both conditions; resource and environment differences remain clear. The home shirt differs by situation, which does not create a different demographic identity. Open books lie on each desk facing the learner, with no audience-facing essential writing; walking perspective and destination are coherent."
