      "aiNotes": "Actual independent image review: curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-visualization-review/wirtschaft-e1-seventeen-image-author-20261008-v1/independent-review/643cb9b3-5b7c-59f6-8383-1af413426c88/independent-image-review.receipt.json (sha256:117d2e20d871078e16e38caefe5aeb13dff025d1c3603313b33f4546a57fe75c). Three equally dignified working arrangements illustrate hands-on work, services and work from different locations. The central question compares activities, time/place and collaboration without asserting a deterministic replacement of industrial work or claiming every remote job is atypical employment. At 360 px workshop, service discussion and remote collaboration are distinguishable, with the central thinking person and comparison icons clear. At 680 px actor roles and time/place/collaboration considerations can be read without numerical trend claims. The mechanic team faces its component and tools; the remote worker faces the actual laptop screen, with notebook lying normally. The service discussion has a correctly placed generic paper."
