      "aiReviewedAt": "2026-10-08",
      "aiReviewer": "OpenAI Codex economics_visual_memory_audit",
      "aiNotes": "Actual independent image review: curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-visualization-review/wirtschaft-e2-twenty-image-author-20261008-v1/independent-review/c386592a-b259-538c-9929-25775af99b83/independent-image-review.receipt.json (sha256:52ee89972dc31cbc85c597d058e434a4fc541f73e186e313a8922a8737033af7). An observable product defect and discussion with a seller/adviser introduce consumer information and protection. Document, gear, leaf and checked-shield symbols support comparing information, quality, environmental issues and safeguards, without false claims about particular refund periods or unconditional rights. At 360 px the damaged backpack, consumer, seller, adviser and large information/protection icons remain identifiable. The book-spine labels are readable enough but not necessary to understand the core scene. At 680 px the actual tear and the consultation posture are clear; the product-information, consumer-protection and sustainability references are legible. The magnifier presents conceptual icons; it does not imply a physically enlarged reversed legal page. No actor is using an upside-down notebook or screen."
    },
