      "aiNotes": "Actual independent image review: curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-visualization-review/wirtschaft-e2-twenty-image-author-20261008-v1/independent-review/5b5ed3cb-7c2c-5b0f-a515-c967d8d23644/independent-image-review.receipt.json (sha256:b2cac4d5c570c8080f94fc5777e024112dd426b8d6c6b744a5a70895fda54067). One shopper compares two backpacks and thinks about budget, practical use and peers. Multiple influence types are distinguished without prescribing an allegedly rational choice or asserting a false price advantage. 360 px makes both alternatives, consumer reflection and the three large thought icons identifiable. 680 px shows both bags and utility/budget/social cues; no small print required. Store monitor faces the salesperson; learner-facing bags and symbolic thought bubbles have no directional text."
