      "aiReviewer": "OpenAI Codex economics_visual_memory_audit",
      "aiNotes": "Actual independent image review: curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-visualization-review/wirtschaft-e2-twenty-image-author-20261008-v1/independent-review/1d38aa8d-c667-5edf-85c1-4111999f03d4/independent-image-review.receipt.json (sha256:e303374203c05fd47c7460e3b15eea42bc4ef0537677dbc513b5bfc6c0fc5479). Two different lenses: economic production/exchange with a schematic growth bar icon, and lived quality with health/social/environment symbols. The unnamed bars are a conceptual growth symbol, not invented quantitative data. No claim equates GDP growth with every dimension of welfare. At 360 px both panel headings, growth bars, family and three welfare icons are recognizable; comparison does not depend on minor factory/school details. 680 px shows production, exchange, education, health and surroundings clearly with the large comparison question. No notebook, instrument or directional worksheet is being used; signage is correctly audience-facing."
    },
