      "aiNotes": "Actual independent image review: curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-visualization-review/wirtschaft-e2-twenty-image-author-20261008-v1/independent-review/21dc877b-e281-5269-8244-05be788f7771/independent-image-review.receipt.json (sha256:b119a192aff57adcd655674d28da55414ee2133a0a06fc66114f8f4a4317f8ff). Independent visible bicycle shops contrast with a possible business agreement examined by an authority. Question-mark and barriers frame the question whether intervention is justified rather than claiming that every agreement or merger is forbidden. This is a suitable qualitative prompt for cartel measures and merger review without invented current legal thresholds. At 360 px separate shops, customers, agreement, barriers and inspecting authority remain clear; the large justification question is readable. At 680 px the distinct shop entrances and agreement examination are easily distinguished without small case facts. The authority holds a magnifier as an inspecting symbol, and customers face the shop interiors correctly; no misoriented legal worksheet or notebook is present."
    },
