      "aiReviewedAt": "2026-10-08",
      "aiReviewer": "OpenAI Codex economics_visual_memory_audit",
      "aiNotes": "Actual independent image review: curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-visualization-review/wirtschaft-e2-twenty-image-author-20261008-v1/independent-review/5262a0ba-0ede-5f47-a6a2-4778d24fc95a/independent-image-review.receipt.json (sha256:e954d9a4ffb41e968bed20bc0acb4bcf4dce41d3782c745140e9b88c013c10b0). Three large labelled lenses contrast production/economic output (BIP), education and health as selected human-development dimensions (HDI), and environmental indicators (Umwelt) over one common town. They contain no invented numerical values or false index formulas. The image illustrates differing perspectives rather than claiming mutually exclusive or exhaustive index components. At 360 px BIP, HDI and Umwelt headings, production arm, book/health and leaf/water symbols remain recognizable. The observer provides a clear common comparison perspective; background micro-details are not needed. At 680 px the common town and the selected detailed production, school, health and ecosystem scenes are clear. The school learner faces an open blank notebook correctly and the health encounter faces both participants; no legible page is upside down for an actor."
